<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><xmap-content xmlns="urn:xmind:xmap:xmlns:content:2.0" xmlns:fo="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Format" xmlns:xhtml="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:svg="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:style="urn:xmind:xmap:xmlns:style:2.0" xmlns:manifest="urn:xmind:xmap:xmlns:manifest:1.0" version="2.0"><sheet id="sheet_376cabae-eb9c-40ed-8df2-5736f545280a"><title>《色，戒》人物关系图</title><topic id="root_7919b704-4cf5-4153-aeeb-f023780c390f"><title>《色，戒》人物关系图</title><children><topics type="attached"><topic id="t_86199fd7-fb3b-4da9-9169-1b1daecf7adf"><title>王佳芝</title><notes><plain>别名：佳芝、麦太太
学生剧团当家花旦，以商人少奶奶身份接近易氏夫妇；当前参与秘密行动。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_518c81ac-243b-4fd1-beb5-f518b4447d30"><title>易先生</title><notes><plain>别名：老易
易太太的丈夫，从事特工工作；与佳芝秘密约会。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_d858cc51-7c83-4135-ad43-90d690a3add4"><title>易太太</title><notes><plain>牌局主人，两年前在香港结识佳芝。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_77afa2ea-be51-4ce2-856b-99e46ff3e050"><title>马太太</title><notes><plain>别名：黑斗篷之一
牌局女客，穿黑斗篷。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_de68020e-6586-45d2-8e70-6f5b60b1c58d"><title>另一位黑斗篷太太</title><notes><plain>马太太对面的牌友，姓名未明。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_8a055e7f-7aaa-41c2-90a0-0b1e9c51b899"><title>廖太太</title><notes><plain>被谈及的牌友，昨日做东。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_6b0d2d88-177e-48bc-8d78-91d7aa0a1284"><title>小李</title><notes><plain>易太太所述昨日宴席上的请客者。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_9b61353b-eb50-4880-9db1-64526e65a0ad"><title>小李太太</title><notes><plain>与小李一同出现在昨日宴席。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_545ec56f-d2a1-454c-a4ad-4e6c9a0a9603"><title>品芬</title><notes><plain>上门提供珠宝的掮客。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_b9f4bfea-9524-4913-aecd-bafe60ff539b"><title>邝裕民</title><notes><plain>别名：二哥
佳芝的行动同伴；扮作麦太太表弟，与吴联络。“二哥”为通话称呼。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_2956108c-2497-41e4-8d6c-91baec32026f"><title>梁闰生</title><notes><plain>学生小集团成员，与佳芝发生亲密关系后关系僵化。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_71a6933a-afb9-4298-af36-7f8e55723c95"><title>黄磊</title><notes><plain>为早期行动筹款、租房、借车并充当司机，后来负债。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_b43264ca-5bb2-42ee-b5ab-12fedc2f1988"><title>欧阳灵文</title><notes><plain>别名：麦先生、小麦
扮演佳芝的商人丈夫；麦先生的婚姻及生意叙述属于掩护身份。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_ee4bbb4e-2321-4699-bc65-f289ded6e96b"><title>赖秀金</title><notes><plain>小集团中除佳芝外唯一的女生。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_34d3253d-0059-4f1d-90ec-479c262f07f8"><title>吴</title><notes><plain>别名：姓吴的
与学生小集团接上线的地下工作者；姓氏真实性受叙述质疑。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_a5fb4003-b646-41fe-b1a3-2ba930d32b0f"><title>副官</title><notes><plain>邝裕民的小同乡，提供消息并引介接近易太太。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_b88ba02b-b0d2-4eaf-b602-67202aad8451"><title>易家女佣</title><notes><plain>向佳芝通报车已等候。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_0fc6a36e-fa80-4ae3-a40c-b6906c0146dc"><title>送佳芝的司机</title><notes><plain>从易家送佳芝到第一家咖啡馆后被打发回去。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_c6a7ba8c-b7f1-433a-873f-16d37b341f74"><title>接易先生的司机</title><notes><plain>替佳芝开车门，随后驾车送两人到珠宝店。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_ae6c2a50-d336-4cd1-b229-2045a6359cc5"><title>中装男子</title><notes><plain>咖啡馆里独自看报并注意佳芝的男子。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_69b0a1be-4c64-49e2-87b5-d149e802ceea"><title>检修单车的男子</title><notes><plain>皮货店门口约三十岁的平头男子，身份不明。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_0bc70eda-6462-435d-8107-9d5b284a7ba4"><title>印度店员</title><notes><plain>别名：那印度人
珠宝店内接待两人并引路上楼。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_9c405ee3-ce98-4792-8e76-08307c3f0384"><title>汪精卫</title><notes><plain>回忆中易氏夫妇跟随的人物。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_bf18d469-6da3-4669-bd8e-009ef28c4548"><title>汪夫人</title><notes><plain>回忆提及的汪精卫妻子。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_56f9e99d-7fa7-482d-b3a8-b40cdc0ff422"><title>陈公博</title><notes><plain>回忆中随汪精卫到香港的人物。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_12474f6c-531e-41fb-b5f6-2cae1418c6d4"><title>曾仲鸣</title><notes><plain>被叙述为已在河内遇刺。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_27807934-5194-4344-a55d-8fa8d26d2746"><title>周佛海</title><notes><plain>因家中窗帘陈设被提及。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_a182c8bc-f123-4b34-99ee-69fe672271bc"><title>巴达先生</title><notes><plain>贺镜题款中的开业受贺者，未确认是否在场。</plain></notes></topic><topic id="t_7ce9a0ff-27f0-48e1-8215-733e084da0d1"><title>陈茂坤</title><notes><plain>贺镜题款中的赠贺者。</plain></notes></topic></topics></children></topic><relationships><relationship id="r_ab0b3726-78b1-47bb-bfef-d26991528d9f"><source ref="t_518c81ac-243b-4fd1-beb5-f518b4447d30"/><target ref="t_d858cc51-7c83-4135-ad43-90d690a3add4"/><title>夫妻：夫妻关系；佳芝认为易太太严密留意丈夫，具体耳目部署只是猜测。</title></relationship><relationship id="r_b422af3c-2f34-4313-aa1f-fa68cafbb560"><source ref="t_86199fd7-fb3b-4da9-9169-1b1daecf7adf"/><target ref="t_d858cc51-7c83-4135-ad43-90d690a3add4"/><title>掩护性交往：以麦太太身份陪购物并获得信任，后来被邀住进易家；接近最初出于小集团计划。</title></relationship><relationship id="r_8ac29db1-0d9c-4f8b-a27e-c8d0ff159034"><source ref="t_86199fd7-fb3b-4da9-9169-1b1daecf7adf"/><target ref="t_b43264ca-5bb2-42ee-b5ab-12fedc2f1988"/><title>假扮夫妻：欧阳灵文扮麦先生，佳芝扮其妻；报复丈夫玩舞女是佳芝向易先生讲过的身份故事，不是已证实婚史。</title></relationship><relationship id="r_f92baf1a-4417-401b-84a1-22f687049eec"><source ref="t_86199fd7-fb3b-4da9-9169-1b1daecf7adf"/><target ref="t_518c81ac-243b-4fd1-beb5-f518b4447d30"/><title>秘密亲密关系与行动目标：早期接近未等到来电；上海阶段已有公寓约会与亲吻。佳芝希望取信于他，将他带往自己指定地点，行动结果未出现。</title></relationship><relationship id="r_9ff8f394-e512-4e2d-a54a-bb4768b2b3b5"><source ref="t_86199fd7-fb3b-4da9-9169-1b1daecf7adf"/><target ref="t_2956108c-2497-41e4-8d6c-91baec32026f"/><title>亲密后疏远：香港行动期间暗示曾多次发生亲密关系，随后关系僵化，佳芝后悔并避嫌。</title></relationship><relationship id="r_a5b04304-659a-480b-a705-128bad2050e0"><source ref="t_86199fd7-fb3b-4da9-9169-1b1daecf7adf"/><target ref="t_b9f4bfea-9524-4913-aecd-bafe60ff539b"/><title>行动同伴：早期共同参与假身份计划；疏远后重新合作，以暗号通话。“二哥”不证明血缘关系。</title></relationship><relationship id="r_b706d4af-1fce-4219-b7d4-3e433abca97b"><source ref="t_34d3253d-0059-4f1d-90ec-479c262f07f8"/><target ref="t_b9f4bfea-9524-4913-aecd-bafe60ff539b"/><title>秘密联络：吴始终直接与邝裕民联络；不信任小集团的动机为佳芝推测。</title></relationship><relationship id="r_aa321679-b1ce-4c18-895d-e599920ecdb8"><source ref="t_b9f4bfea-9524-4913-aecd-bafe60ff539b"/><target ref="t_a5fb4003-b646-41fe-b1a3-2ba930d32b0f"/><title>同乡与消息渠道：凭小同乡关系取得消息，副官又协助引介。</title></relationship><relationship id="r_a32541c5-6a9a-4fc0-8921-1e3b2a4f0977"><source ref="t_86199fd7-fb3b-4da9-9169-1b1daecf7adf"/><target ref="t_77afa2ea-be51-4ce2-856b-99e46ff3e050"/><title>猜测的嫉妒：佳芝疑心马太太因自己成为中心而吃醋，不能认定马太太真实心理。</title></relationship></relationships></sheet></xmap-content>